            <title>[ZEPPELIN-634] Build failure due to latest bower (1.7.5)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-634</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
